    body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 8px; }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: #f8fafc; }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #cbd5e1; border-radius: 4px; }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover { background: #94a3b8; }
  </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-50 text-slate-900 min-h-screen flex flex-col items-center p-6 relative overflow-x-hidden pt-10">
  
  <!-- Background Image -->
  <div class="fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[url('/images/telkomschools.jpg')] bg-cover bg-center bg-no-repeat blur-xl scale-110 opacity-40"></div>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-slate-50/80"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="relative z-10 w-full max-w-4xl">
    <!-- Top Navigation Header -->
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-start sm:items-center mb-8 gap-4">
      <div>
        <a href="/" class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-red-600 tracking-tight hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity">MokletCare</a>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-0.5">SMK Telkom Malang Facility Management Portal</p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <a href="/" class="text-xs bg-white text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-50 px-3.5 py-2 rounded-lg transition-colors border border-slate-200 font-medium shadow-sm flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-slate-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 19l-7-7m0 0l7-7m-7 7h18"></path></svg>
          Back to Portal
        </a>
        <a href="/tos" class="text-xs bg-red-50 text-red-600 hover:bg-red-100 px-3.5 py-2 rounded-lg transition-colors border border-red-200 font-medium">
          Terms of Service
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Content Card -->
    <div class="bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-xl border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-10 shadow-xl mb-12">
      <div class="border-b border-slate-200 pb-6 mb-8">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-red-50 text-red-600 mb-3 border border-red-100">
          <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"></path></svg>
          Legal Documentation
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-2">Effective Date: August 27, 2026 &bull; Last Revised: August 2026</p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-8 text-slate-700 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
        
        <!-- Section 1 -->
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-red-100 text-red-600 text-xs font-bold shrink-0">1</span>
            Introduction & Scope
          </h2>
          <p>
            Welcome to <strong>MokletCare</strong> ("we", "our", or "us"). MokletCare is the official facility damage reporting and maintenance management portal for <strong>SMK Telkom Malang</strong>. We respect the privacy of our students, educators, administrative staff, and authorized visitors. This Privacy Policy details the types of information we collect, how we handle and protect that information, and your rights regarding the data submitted through our platform.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-2">
            By accessing or using MokletCare at any domain or client interface, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and consented to the practices described in this Privacy Policy.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 2 -->
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-red-100 text-red-600 text-xs font-bold shrink-0">2</span>
            Information We Collect
          </h2>
          <p class="mb-3">To maintain account security and manage campus repairs effectively, we collect the following categories of information:</p>
          
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50/50">
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 text-sm mb-1 flex items-center gap-1.5">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-red-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M16 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0zM12 14a7 7 0 00-7 7h14a7 7 0 00-7-7z"></path></svg>
                Identity & Authentication Data
              </h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-600">
                When you sign in via Single Sign-On (Google or Apple via Clerk), we receive your display name, primary email address, profile identifier, and assigned role (<span class="font-mono text-slate-800">reporter</span>, <span class="font-mono text-slate-800">staff</span>, or <span class="font-mono text-slate-800">admin</span>).
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50/50">
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 text-sm mb-1 flex items-center gap-1.5">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-red-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z"></path></svg>
                Damage Report Information
              </h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-600">
                Location specifics (e.g. room number, laboratory), facility type, damaged item classifications, urgency levels, problem descriptions, and uploaded photographic proof.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50/50">
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 text-sm mb-1 flex items-center gap-1.5">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-red-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 16l4.586-4.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L16 16m-2-2l1.586-1.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L20 14m-6-6h.01M6 20h12a2 2 0 002-2V6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z"></path></svg>
                Media & Attachments
              </h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-600">
                Photographs uploaded to document physical damage. Images are securely hosted through Cloudinary and stored with strict file-type and size constraints (max 5MB).
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50/50">
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 text-sm mb-1 flex items-center gap-1.5">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-red-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 3v2m6-2v2M9 19v2m6-2v2M5 9H3m2 6H3m18-6h-2m2 6h-2M7 19h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2zM9 9h6v6H9V9z"></path></svg>
                Technical & Diagnostic Data
              </h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-600">
                IP addresses, browser client headers, session cookies (<span class="font-mono text-slate-800">__session</span>), rate-limiting state, timestamp logs, and error telemetry for fraud prevention and stability.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 3 -->
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-red-100 text-red-600 text-xs font-bold shrink-0">3</span>
            How We Use Your Information
          </h2>
          <p>We process collected data exclusively for institutional operational purposes, including:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-2 space-y-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600">
            <li><strong>Verifying & Triaging Reports:</strong> Validating the authenticity of repair requests and prioritizing critical safety hazards.</li>
            <li><strong>Maintenance Dispatch & Tracking:</strong> Enabling school technicians and janitorial staff to locate and repair damaged infrastructure.</li>
            <li><strong>Accountability & Prevention of Abuse:</strong> Preventing spam submissions, prank reports, and unauthorized tampering through authenticated user logging and rate limits.</li>
            <li><strong>Status Notifications:</strong> Allowing reporters to monitor ticket progress through the personal reports history interface.</li>
            <li><strong>Institutional Analytics:</strong> Aggregating facility failure metrics to assist SMK Telkom Malang with long-term procurement and budgeting.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 4 -->
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-red-100 text-red-600 text-xs font-bold shrink-0">4</span>
            Data Sharing & Third-Party Service Providers
          </h2>
          <p>
            <strong>We do not sell, rent, monetize, or trade your personal data.</strong> Your information is only accessible to authorized school administrators and the following trusted infrastructure sub-processors:
          </p>
          <div class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm">
            <div class="p-3 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg border border-slate-200">
              <strong>Clerk (Authentication Provider):</strong> Manages encrypted OAuth Single Sign-On and session token validation.
            </div>
            <div class="p-3 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg border border-slate-200">
              <strong>Cloudinary (Media Hosting):</strong> Securely stores and optimizes uploaded damage evidence photos over TLS encryption.
            </div>
            <div class="p-3 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg border border-slate-200">
              <strong>PostgreSQL Database Service:</strong> Hosts relational report records and role authorizations with parameterized query safeguards.
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 5 -->
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-red-100 text-red-600 text-xs font-bold shrink-0">5</span>
            Data Security & Retention
          </h2>
          <p>
            We implement industry-standard technical safeguards, including HTTPS transport encryption, strict role-based access control (RBAC), rate-limiting mechanisms, and sanitized database queries to prevent unauthorized disclosure or tampering.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-2">
            Facility reports and associated photographic records are retained as part of the school's historical maintenance archives. Inactive accounts may be purged periodically in accordance with school IT policies.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 6 -->
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-red-100 text-red-600 text-xs font-bold shrink-0">6</span>
            User Rights & Account Controls
          </h2>
          <p>As a registered user of the MokletCare portal, you have the right to:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-2 space-y-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600">
            <li>Review all past tickets and submissions made under your email account on the <a href="/history" class="text-red-600 font-medium hover:underline">My Reports</a> page.</li>
            <li>Request clarification or escalation on any report status directly with the school administration.</li>
            <li>Request removal of personal identifying information upon graduation or discontinuation of affiliation with SMK Telkom Malang.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 7 -->
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-red-100 text-red-600 text-xs font-bold shrink-0">7</span>
            Contact & Inquiries
          </h2>
          <p>
            If you have questions, concerns, or requests regarding this Privacy Policy or the security of your data on MokletCare, please contact:
          </p>
          <div class="mt-3 p-4 bg-red-50/60 border border-red-200 rounded-xl text-slate-800 text-xs sm:text-sm">
            <p class="font-bold text-slate-900">MokletCare Support Team</p>
            <p class="mt-1">SMK Telkom Malang &bull; IT & Infrastructure Division</p>
            <p>Email: <a href="mailto:support@smktelkom-mlg.sch.id" class="text-red-600 font-medium hover:underline">support@smktelkom-mlg.sch.id</a></p>
            <p>Website: <a href="https://smktelkom-mlg.sch.id" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-red-600 font-medium hover:underline">smktelkom-mlg.sch.id</a></p>
          </div>
        </section>

      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <div class="text-center pb-8 text-xs text-slate-500 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-2 sm:gap-4">
      <span>&copy; 2026 Ahnaf, Rafale, and Baruna &bull; MokletCare</span>
      <span class="hidden sm:inline">&bull;</span>
      <div class="flex gap-3">
        <a href="/privacy-policy" class="text-red-600 font-medium hover:underline">Privacy Policy</a>
        <span class="text-slate-300">|</span>
        <a href="/tos" class="text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900 hover:underline">Terms of Service</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</body>
